 "scenes": [
  {
   "dur": 3.4,
   "voz": "¿Te suben el sueldo y crees que vas a cobrar menos por cambiar de tramo? Es un mito.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0\">Mito o realidad · IRPF</div><h1 data-in=\"0\" data-d=\"0.4\">“Si me suben el sueldo, <span class=\"g\">cobraré menos</span>.”</h1><p data-in=\"0.3\">Lo que pasa de verdad al cambiar de tramo.</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 400\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:50px\"><path d=\"M60,360 H240 V290 H420 V220 H600 V150 H780 V80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-in=\"0.4\" data-d=\"0.9\" data-a=\"draw\"/><circle cx=\"780\" cy=\"80\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"pop\"/></svg></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "El IRPF funciona por escalones. Cada tipo se aplica solo a la parte de tu base que cae dentro de ese escalón.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Cómo funciona</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Cada tipo grava <span class=\"g\">solo su escalón</span>.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 440\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"330\" width=\"124\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" data-in=\"0.50\" data-d=\"0.5\" data-a=\"growy\"/><text x=\"66\" y=\"312\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"fade\">19 %</text><text x=\"66\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"fade\">12.450</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"275\" width=\"124\" height=\"105\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" data-in=\"0.65\" data-d=\"0.5\" data-a=\"growy\"/><text x=\"206\" y=\"257\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.9500000000000001\" data-a=\"fade\">24 %</text><text x=\"206\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.65\" data-a=\"fade\">20.200</text><rect x=\"284\" y=\"220\" width=\"124\" height=\"160\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.80\" data-d=\"0.5\" data-a=\"growy\"/><text x=\"346\" y=\"202\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"fade\">30 %</text><text x=\"346\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"fade\">35.200</text><rect x=\"424\" y=\"165\" width=\"124\" height=\"215\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" data-in=\"0.95\" data-d=\"0.5\" data-a=\"growy\"/><text x=\"486\" y=\"147\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.25\" data-a=\"fade\">37 %</text><text x=\"486\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.95\" data-a=\"fade\">60.000</text><rect x=\"564\" y=\"110\" width=\"124\" height=\"270\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" data-in=\"1.10\" data-d=\"0.5\" data-a=\"growy\"/><text x=\"626\" y=\"92\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.4\" data-a=\"fade\">45 %</text><text x=\"626\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"fade\">300.000</text><rect x=\"704\" y=\"55\" width=\"124\" height=\"325\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" data-in=\"1.25\" data-d=\"0.5\" data-a=\"growy\"/><text x=\"766\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.55\" data-a=\"fade\">47 %</text><text x=\"766\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.25\" data-a=\"fade\">+300.000</text></svg><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"1.6\" data-a=\"fade\">Escala general de ejemplo (estatal + autonómica que copia la estatal), base liquidable en €. Cada comunidad tiene la suya.</div></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Un ejemplo. Tu base pasa de veinte mil a veintiún mil euros, y superas el límite de veinte mil doscientos.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">El ejemplo</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Te suben <span class=\"g\">1.000&nbsp;€</span> al año.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 400\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"120\" width=\"762\" height=\"90\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-d=\"0.6\" data-a=\"grow\"/><rect x=\"782\" y=\"120\" width=\"38\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-d=\"0.4\" data-a=\"grow\"/><line x1=\"790\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"790\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#F5F5F2\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"fade\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"175\" fill=\"#0A0A0A\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.7\" data-a=\"fade\">20.000 €</text><text x=\"790\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"fade\">Límite: 20.200 €</text><text x=\"820\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-in=\"1.2\" data-a=\"fade\">+1.000 € de subida</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.5\" data-a=\"fade\">Nueva base: 21.000 €</text></svg></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "El treinta por ciento solo se aplica a los ochocientos euros que pasan del límite. Lo de abajo tributa igual que antes.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">La cuenta</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">El 30&nbsp;% solo toca <span class=\"g\">800&nbsp;€</span>.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 410\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"840\" height=\"125\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"4\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"fade\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"52\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.6\" data-a=\"fade\">200 €</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"78\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.7\" data-a=\"fade\">al 24 %</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"52\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-in=\"0.9\" data-a=\"fade\">48 €</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"150\" width=\"840\" height=\"125\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"4\" data-in=\"0.9\" data-a=\"fade\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"52\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\">800 €</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"228\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"fade\">al 30 %</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"52\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"fade\">240 €</text><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"320\" stroke=\"#6F6F6F\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-in=\"1.4\" data-a=\"fade\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.5\" data-a=\"fade\">Impuesto de la subida</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"56\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-in=\"1.6\" data-a=\"fade\">288 €</text></svg></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Resultado: de los mil euros de subida, pagas doscientos ochenta y ocho de impuesto y te quedas con setecientos doce. Cobras más, no menos.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Resultado</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Cobras <span class=\"g\">más</span>, no menos.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 400\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"598\" height=\"130\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-d=\"0.7\" data-a=\"grow\"/><rect x=\"606\" y=\"40\" width=\"234\" height=\"130\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-d=\"0.5\" data-a=\"grow\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#0A0A0A\" font-size=\"48\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\">712 € para ti</text><text x=\"723\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"fade\">288 €</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.4\" data-a=\"fade\">De cada subida de 1.000 €, te quedas con</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"130\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.5\" data-a=\"count\" data-to=\"712\" data-suf=\" €\">0 €</text></svg><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"1.6\" data-a=\"fade\">Cálculo propio con la escala de ejemplo, sin deducciones ni mínimos personales.</div></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "¿Y por qué a veces la nómina sorprende? Porque cambia la retención. Pero es un adelanto, y se ajusta en la declaración de la renta.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Ojo con la nómina</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Lo que cambia es la <span class=\"g\">retención</span>.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 330\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:70px\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"370\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"4\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"fade\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.6\" data-a=\"fade\">Retención</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"180\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.6\" data-a=\"fade\">en tu nómina</text><path d=\"M400,140 L440,140\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-in=\"0.9\" data-d=\"0.3\" data-a=\"draw\"/><path d=\"M425,120 L448,140 L425,160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"fade\"/><rect x=\"470\" y=\"40\" width=\"370\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"4\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"fade\"/><text x=\"655\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.2\" data-a=\"fade\">La renta</text><text x=\"655\" y=\"180\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.2\" data-a=\"fade\">ajusta la diferencia</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.7\" data-a=\"fade\">Es un adelanto</text><text x=\"655\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"fade\">Te devuelven o pagas</text></svg></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Cambiar de tramo no hace que cobres menos. Envíaselo a quien aún se lo cree, y síguenos para entender tu dinero, sin humo.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Mito desmontado</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Cambiar de tramo <span class=\"g\">no te hace cobrar menos</span>.</h2><p data-in=\"1.0\">Envíaselo a quien aún se lo cree. Y síguenos para entender tu dinero <span class=\"g\">sin humo</span>.</p><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"1.4\" data-a=\"fade\">Ejemplo simplificado. Datos a 24/11/2026. Contenido informativo, no es asesoramiento financiero.</div></div>"
  }
 ]
